{"4269670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyberdelia: Micro", "steam_appid": 4269670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberdelia: Micro</strong> is a psychedelic, retro-inspired JRPG where drugs are your best friend. Play as Xaxis, a cyberdelic, robot orbskull summoned to the spiritual planet of Summscatchaland to save the world. But before Xaxis can do that, he must first earn the blessings of the remaining Lucky Gods scattered across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive, 10 hour journey through a world with 4 distinct areas and more to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic, turn-based combat system visually inspired by retro JRPGs, loaded with dozens of animations, unique items, playstyles and general chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A memorable, eclectic soundtrack, fusing 8-bit chiptunes with psychedelia, jazz, reggae and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trippy, colorful 8-bit visuals with mixed media elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mythological and spiritual setting, inspired by several cultures and traditions from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious yet engaging narrative headed by a strong cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overall stylistic gameplay experience, crafted with a surrealist ethos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of twists and turns...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberdelia: Micro</strong> is a psychedelic, retro-inspired JRPG where drugs are your best friend. Play as Xaxis, a cyberdelic, robot orbskull summoned to the spiritual planet of Summscatchaland to save the world. But before Xaxis can do that, he must first earn the blessings of the remaining Lucky Gods scattered across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive, 10 hour journey through a world with 4 distinct areas and more to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic, turn-based combat system visually inspired by retro JRPGs, loaded with dozens of animations, unique items, playstyles and general chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A memorable, eclectic soundtrack, fusing 8-bit chiptunes with psychedelia, jazz, reggae and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trippy, colorful 8-bit visuals with mixed media elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mythological and spiritual setting, inspired by several cultures and traditions from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious yet engaging narrative headed by a strong cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overall stylistic gameplay experience, crafted with a surrealist ethos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of twists and turns...</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Cyberdelia: Micro is a psychedelic, retro-inspired JRPG where drugs are your best friend. You play as Xaxis, a cyberdelic robot sent to a spiritual land to prevent the end of the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269670/77f2152ffb3a25d056ef37d15da9a80201db309a/header.jpg?t=1777525220", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269670/bbdbab7fff298c7ba3d31262ad08be80af4cdb05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777525220", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269670/bbdbab7fff298c7ba3d31262ad08be80af4cdb05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777525220", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br